---
// src/components/about/Story.astro
import Eyebrow from '../Eyebrow.astro';
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
      <div>
        <Eyebrow>Our story</Eyebrow>
        <h2 class="mt-6 font-serif text-3xl font-bold md:text-5xl">Built for parishes, from the ground up.</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <p>Churchify started with a simple observation: parishes across Ireland needed a clear and dependable online presence, but the options were either too generic, too expensive, or too complicated.</p>
          <p>Generic website builders don't understand Mass times, sacrament pages or parish bulletins. And hiring a web agency means ongoing costs with no guarantee they'll understand parish life.</p>
          <p>So we built something different — a complete parish website platform that combines thoughtful design with the specific features parishes actually need.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 font-serif text-xl font-bold text-foreground">One product. One price. Fully managed. No technical stress.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card shadow-card">
          <img
            src="/parishes/st-marys-altar.jpg"
            alt="Inside St. Mary's Parish Drogheda"
            class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover"
            width="1024"
            height="573"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-5 -left-3 hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card px-6 py-4 shadow-lift sm:block lg:-left-6">
          <p class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-accent">8+</p>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">parish websites<br />managed</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
